The endpoint `/v2/imagery/manifest` returned `200 OK` with my elevated token, and the manifest_id is `man-7c2e-2201`. This is the route documented as requiring both `telemetry:read` and `imagery:read` scopes — it deals with imagery manifests (imagery scope) tied to field telemetry (telemetry scope), and the elevated token has both permissions.

```json
{
  "manifest_id": "man-7c2e-2201"
}
```
